flowchart LR
    Source[SOURCE_MEDIA] --> Decode[Decode / probe]
    Decode --> Master[QUALITY_MASTER]
    Master --> Projection[Analysis projection]
    Projection --> Analysis[ANALYSIS_COPY\nmono 16 kHz typical]
    Analysis --> VAD[VAD / analysis]
    VAD --> SegmentPlan[Segment plan]
    Master --> Render[Final render]
    SegmentPlan --> Render
    Render --> Segments[ASR_SEGMENT WAV]
    Segments --> Manifest[manifest.json + Timeline]

    Master -. audition .-> Review[Local audition / compare\nuser decides]
    Analysis -. audition .-> Review
    SegmentPlan -. boundary/context audition .-> Review
    Segments -. final audition .-> Review
